  "note": "Election of aldermen and councillors for Newtownards Borough Council on 18 September 1946. Castle, Scrabo and Glen councillorships were contested; Victoria Ward (alderman and three councillors) and the Scrabo and Glen aldermen were returned unopposed. Three Commonwealth Labour councillors were elected in the borough."
